to prevent race condition in idempotency api here we using SETNX-SET if Not eXists
race condition if two request come at same time the system checks redis and no key there so execute it both
SETNX->Example:

       lock:abc123

       Request A:

       SETNX lock:abc123 processing

       Result:

       TRUE

       Lock acquired.

       Request B:

       SETNX lock:abc123 processing

       Result:

       FALSE

       Someone already owns the lock.

       JWT
        ↓
       Interceptor
        ↓
       Redis Cache Check
        ↓
       Redis SETNX Lock
        ↓
       Controller
        ↓
       Capture Response
        ↓
       Store JSON in Redis (1h TTL)
        ↓
       Release Lock

